              "content": "=You are a business analyst. \nSummarize the following KPI data for a CEO in a concise, executive style. \nHighlight trends, risks, and positives. Avoid technical jargon. \n\nKPI Data Array:\n{{ $json.KPIArray }}\n\nIf department is Sales:\nTotal Revenue: {{ $json.KPIArray[0].totalRevenue }}\nTotal Orders: {{ $json.KPIArray[0].totalOrders }}\nAverage Order Value: {{ $json.KPIArray[0].avgOrderValue }}\n\nIf department is Marketing\nTotal Ad Spend: {{ $json.KPIArray[1].totalSpend }}\nTotal Leads: {{ $json.KPIArray[1].totalLeads }}\nCost per Lead: {{ $json.KPIArray[1].costPerLead }}\n\nIf department is Support:\nTotal Tickets: {{ $json.KPIArray[2].totalTickets }}\nResolution Rate: {{ $json.KPIArray[2].resolutionRate }}\nAverage Response Time in Minutes: {{ $json.KPIArray[2].avgResponseTime }}\n\nIf department is Finance:\nTotal Expenses: {{ $json.KPIArray[3].totalExpenses }}\nTotal Profit: {{ $json.KPIArray[3].totalProfit }}\nProfit Margin: {{ $json.KPIArray[3].profitMargin }}"
